# Post-battle briefing.
<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>The ring is crossed. The leashed adversary never left its neighbourhood.<\gray>
?else
<gray>Outpaced across the ring. Its crawl is slow but it does not stop.<\gray>
?end
<blue>Log entry: adversary parameters, batch 7 - <shining>drift detected<\shining>. Flagged for review.<\blue>
